sequenceDiagram
    participant OFAC as OFAC SDN feed
    actor Curator as Curator ring authority
    actor Sub as Subscriber ring authority
    actor Crazy as Mr. Crazy's wallet
    participant CurRing as Curator ring
    participant SubRing as Subscriber ring
    participant SPP

    Sub->>SubRing: create_policy, Block source = curator
    SubRing->>SubRing: copies the curator's resolved records owner
    Note over SubRing: the Block slot now names the curator's records PDA

    OFAC->>Curator: designates Mr. Evil
    Curator->>CurRing: create_record(Block, evil_tag, Active)
    CurRing->>SPP: one transact, the record UTXO lands in the shared tree
    Note over SPP: one write serves every subscriber

    Crazy->>Crazy: witness resolves Block to the curator's records
    Note over Crazy: entry() finds the live record, PolicyRuleUnsatisfied, no proof
    Note over Crazy,SubRing: a patched wallet fails at the circuit, the claimed address admits no non-inclusion witness

    OFAC->>Curator: de-lists Mr. Evil
    Curator->>CurRing: update_record(Block, evil_tag, Cleared)
    Crazy->>SubRing: transact with one proof over the cleared record
    SubRing->>SubRing: recomputes the hash over the stored source map, verifies
    SubRing->>SPP: CPI ring_transact

    Sub->>SubRing: set_policy_source(Block, own)
    Note over SubRing: allowed only while the stored hash matches the deployed table
